    "approach": "Add logic to process `__doc__` assignments similar to how regular variables are handled. Specifically in the `_handleAssignmentInModule`, `_handleAssignmentInClass`, etc., methods that deal with attribute/variable processing, treat `__doc__` specially when assigning to existing Function/Method objects.",
    "files_to_edit": [
